  "title": "Run Claude Code and Cursor for FREE",
  "description": "Free API tiers aren't charity.\n\nThey're providers bidding for you.\n\nEvery one of them wants developer lock-in.\n\nSo they hand out free inference.\n\nGemini, Groq, NVIDIA all do it.\n\nPermanent free tiers, not trials.\n\nThe cost was never the real barrier.\n\nFinding them was.\n\nForty providers, forty signup pages.\n\nSo most people give up and pay.\n\nThis repo lists over 130.\n\nOne place, every free tier.\n\nOne click into Claude Code.\n\nSame for Codex and Cursor.\n\nYour agents run on someone else's budget.\n\nLike forty stores handing out samples.\n\nMost people never walk in.\n\nThe models are the same either way.\n\nOnly the invoice changes.\n\nGo collect the free tiers.\n\n#github #gemini #groq #claudecode #cursor",
